  message: "Shipped in PR #3185 (commit 97d138ef9). Linker emits contains_routes edges for decorator-based controller frameworks (NestJS/Spring/ASP.NET/Laravel/Symfony/Phoenix/Micronaut/Ktor/Grails/CakePHP). controller concept flipped inert → live in docs/CONCEPTS.md. 16 tests, 100% coverage, 100% per-package coverage. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation — numerical FP-reduction claim to be made against a bakeoff cohort containing at least one decorator-based controller framework. Rails and Django CBVs explicitly out of scope (different dispatch model handled by route_handler.py)."  # a7ae
